  "reasoning": "The facts describe a series of seven incidents in which the defendant, together with co‑offenders, used a motorbike to break into homes, warehouses and factories and secretly took motor vehicles, refrigerators, welding machines, batteries, fertilizers, etc. All acts are described as secret taking of others' property for personal gain. The total value of the stolen items is 92,039 yuan, which meets the statutory threshold for \"large amount\" theft. No other criminal conduct (e.g., fraud, drug offenses, violent offenses) is mentioned. Therefore the appropriate charge is theft (盗窃).",
